0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/microsoft-skills/</guid><description/></item><item><title>skills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/scenario-labs-skills/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/scenario-labs-skills/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenTools</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/opentools/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/opentools/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;OpenTools is a catalog for finding AI products. Visitors search or filter by what they want to do, see short descriptions and pricing information, and follow links to the tools. Beyond products, the site lists models and Model Context Protocol servers, which are useful to developers building agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guides and news help readers understand what is new and how to use tools well. Builders can submit their products for listing, which is how most directories grow.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Skill_Seekers</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/yusufkaraaslan-skill-seekers/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/yusufkaraaslan-skill-seekers/</guid><description/></item><item><title>beacon.sh</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/beacon-sh/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/beacon-sh/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;beacon.sh addresses a limit of coding agents: they start each session knowing little about the project. Beacon watches what the agent does, such as commands that work, mistakes it makes, and conventions it discovers, and stores them as notes the agent can use next time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It works with popular coding agents and keeps the memory in files and a local store the developer can inspect and edit. Over time, that cuts repeated explanations and failed attempts.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>